Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:03.75,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(446,430)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.05,0:01:13.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:13.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.78,0:01:16.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:16.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right there
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.30,0:01:19.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有种不对劲的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:19.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Something don't smell right
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.04,0:01:22.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你那边是在烧什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:22.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, say, what are you burnin' out here, boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.55,0:01:25.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是高级炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.55,0:01:25.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd say a high grade explosive
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.10,0:01:27.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,炸药吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.10,0:01:27.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Explosive?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.40,0:01:35.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好享受  尤金
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:35.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Enjoy, Eugene
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.05,0:01:41.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:41.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.76,0:01:46.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,屋顶上周刚重修了一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:46.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just had that roof redone last week
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.75,0:01:50.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我炸完  就再重修一遍去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:50.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll be re-redoing it after I'm through with you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.80,0:01:51.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,弹药准备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:51.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ready ammunition
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.29,0:01:53.00,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1014,430)}豆子
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.46,0:01:56.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:56.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fire
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.45,0:02:12.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找掩护
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.45,0:02:12.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take cover
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.22,0:02:19.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:19.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It didn't go off
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.55,0:02:22.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又是哑炮  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:22.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another dud, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.50,0:02:24.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哑炮是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:24.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A dud, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.85,0:02:32.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这是在玩火  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:32.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're playin' with fire now, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.25,0:02:34.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没必要对这种事发火  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:34.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to get worked up over this, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.90,0:02:37.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方给我  我自然会走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:37.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just give me the secret formula, and I'll be on my way
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.55,0:02:38.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不给 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:38.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You ain't getting it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.12,0:02:41.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请你再考虑一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:41.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I implore you to reconsider
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.45,0:02:45.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我上甲板跳海
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:45.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go jump off a plank
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.18,0:02:48.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,套取信息的办法多着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:48.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have ways of getting the information I need
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.42,0:02:50.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方在哪  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:50.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's the formula, Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.17,0:02:56.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还不招啊  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:56.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Still not gonna talk, eh, Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.32,0:03:02.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老螃蟹  看来你还挺硬气的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:02.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Krabs, I see you're not gonna crack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.92,0:03:05.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可你的手下未必有你那种毅力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:05.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I don't think your underling is of the same mettle
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.00,0:03:06.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我绝对不招
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:06.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll never talk
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.92,0:03:10.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看羽毛有什么话要说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:10.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll see what Mr. Feather has to say about that
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.25,0:03:10.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:10.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.85,0:03:11.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:11.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.60,0:03:12.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我不懂怎么开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:12.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I don't know how to get
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.57,0:03:14.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板办公室的画后面那个保险箱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:14.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,into the safe behind the painting in Mr. Krabs' office
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.49,0:03:15.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方就在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:15.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that houses the secret formula
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.85,0:03:16.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他从来不让我碰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.85,0:03:16.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He won't let me near it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.55,0:03:19.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:19.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Clever
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.52,0:03:21.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,藏画后面是吧  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:21.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Behind the painting, eh, Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.78,0:03:24.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话说回来  哪来的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:24.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, what am I smelling?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.52,0:03:25.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这有东西烧了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:25.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got something burning?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闻着像鲸油
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Smells like blubber to me
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.10,0:03:29.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鲸鲸  鲸油
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.10,0:03:29.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blu-blu-blubber?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.08,0:03:31.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:31.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.67,0:03:34.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把你女儿叫走  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:34.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Call off your daughter, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.30,0:03:35.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快叫她走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.30,0:03:35.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Call her off
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.23,0:03:36.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她都长大了  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:36.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's a big girl, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.64,0:03:38.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想做什么我管不着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:38.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no control over what she does
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you better watch out
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.55,0:03:42.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她今天好像特别饿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:42.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think she's extra hungry today
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,退后  鲸鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stay back, whale
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.39,0:03:46.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道你会怎么虐待我这种有机体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:46.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm privy to what you do to organisms like me
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.82,0:03:48.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,纪录片我都看过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.82,0:03:48.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've seen those documentaries
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他这是进冰库了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did he just go into the freezer?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.33,0:03:54.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:54.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't say it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.21,0:03:58.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我宁愿吃沙拉也不吃痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:58.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I prefer salad over Plankton anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板原来这么怕鲸鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who knew Plankton was so afraid of whales?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.70,0:04:04.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍  我的宝贝女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:04.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl, me darlin' daughter
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.25,0:04:07.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你保住了我的生意  还有秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.25,0:04:07.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you saved me business and me formula
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快帮咱脱离陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now get us out of this trap
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.82,0:04:10.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逛商场的钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:10.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mall money?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.35,0:04:12.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:12.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, all right
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.53,0:04:14.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你越来越像你老爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.53,0:04:14.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're getting more like your old man every day
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, daddy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.12,0:04:21.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然顺路  要不先去趟海之霸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:21.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you swing by the chum bucket
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.85,0:04:22.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后再去商场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.85,0:04:22.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on your way to the mall?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.97,0:04:24.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吓一吓痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:24.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give Plankton a scare
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.66,0:04:26.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钱得翻倍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:26.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Double my mall money
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你来出钱  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your turn to chip in, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.35,0:04:29.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:29.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.34,0:04:29.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:29.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here you go
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.92,0:04:30.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给自己买点漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:30.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Buy yourself something pretty
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.77,0:04:34.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这又不是钱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.77,0:04:34.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This isn't money
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.32,0:04:35.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比钱好得很
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:35.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it's even better
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:40.30,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(418,784)}假币\N非法定货币
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.94,0:04:38.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板就拿这个付我工资
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:38.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is what Mr. Krabs pays me with
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.53,0:04:40.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板假币
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:40.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs' wacky bucks
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,报应来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's all starting to catch up with me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.97,0:04:44.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:44.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.05,0:04:45.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我替你做作业
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.05,0:04:45.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do your homework for you
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想得美
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.85,0:04:49.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咱就是说  海之霸恶心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:49.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The chum bucket is, like, totally gross
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.05,0:04:52.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样的话  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:52.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In that case, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.32,0:04:55.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我找你借件裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:55.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need to borrow one of your dresses
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:58.06,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524,550)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.47,0:05:02.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老公得胜归来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.47,0:05:02.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My triumphant husband returns
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.26,0:05:03.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这次怎么失败的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:03.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How'd you fail this time?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.80,0:05:05.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老螃蟹有头鲸鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:05.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabs had a whale
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.25,0:05:08.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是说他养的高大可怕青少年女儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:08.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean his big, bad, scary teenage daughter?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.62,0:05:11.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听出来你在嘲讽我了  凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:11.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hear that mocking tone in your voice, Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.15,0:05:12.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:12.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I don't appreciate it
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就不记得我的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what happened to my ancestors
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被野兽玩弄于股掌之间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at the hands of those beasts?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.20,0:05:27.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等你什么时候暂时不被害妄想了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:25.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, when you need a break
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:27.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from your delusional paranoia
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.57,0:05:29.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就去倒下垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:29.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the trash needs some attention
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.60,0:05:30.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都臭掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:30.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's ripened
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.30,0:05:37.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:37.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.92,0:05:50.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样就能挡住她了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:50.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That should keep her out
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.72,0:05:56.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要吃浮游生物的肉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:56.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want plankton meat
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.17,0:05:57.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:57.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Holy protozoa
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.47,0:05:59.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:05:59.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.40,0:06:00.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:00.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's here
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.07,0:06:00.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.07,0:06:00.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She got in
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.10,0:06:02.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:02.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.02,0:06:04.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实验室闹鲸鱼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:04.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a whale in the laboratory
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你发什么神经
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.47,0:06:07.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自己看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:07.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See for yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本没鲸鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No whale in here
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.22,0:06:14.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚里面肯定有鲸鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:14.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I swear, a whale was just in here
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.82,0:06:16.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在突变分析仪旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:16.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She was next to the transmutator
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.02,0:06:19.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在这个位置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:19.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She was right here in this spot
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.76,0:06:21.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,口吐白沫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:21.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Her mouth all frothy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.47,0:06:23.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,头顶喷水
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.47,0:06:23.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,blowhole blowing
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别说了  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.97,0:06:26.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.97,0:06:26.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.22,0:06:29.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得继续执行二进制函数了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:29.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to get back to more pertinent binary functions
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.08,0:06:30.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:30.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.86,0:06:31.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:31.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.87,0:06:33.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不听不听
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:33.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not listening
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:37.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,充斥着被害妄想的十六天后
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.66,0:06:39.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  饭好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:39.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton, your dinner's ready
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.50,0:06:41.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:41.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  听到没
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.87,0:06:45.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我听得到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:45.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can hear you
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.72,0:06:47.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以端过来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:47.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you bring it up?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我见不得光
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't risk stepping into the light
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鲸鱼可能会看到我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The whale might see me
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.32,0:07:04.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:04.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.19,0:07:21.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.19,0:07:21.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.23,0:07:26.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好啊  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:26.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hiya, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.30,0:07:29.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真高兴你能跟家人团聚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:29.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Glad you could join the rest of the family
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.45,0:07:30.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:30.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Granddad?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.42,0:07:32.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  你胆子还真不小
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:32.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep, and you're pretty brave
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,敢站在那滩胃酸里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,standing in that there gastric acid
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.92,0:07:36.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胃酸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:36.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gastric acid?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.88,0:07:46.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:46.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't take it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.84,0:07:49.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快逼疯我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:49.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is driving me crazy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.20,0:08:02.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,活下去还有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:02.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the point of going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.57,0:08:06.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我余生都要被那鲸鱼折磨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:04.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just be tortured
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:06.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the rest of my life by that whale
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不活了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm done
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.05,0:08:12.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四点十五的公交应该就快过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:12.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The 4:15 bus should be along any time now
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.44,0:08:13.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:13.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.62,0:08:15.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你躺马路上面干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:15.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What you doin' laying here in the middle of the road?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.47,0:08:17.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚开  起司头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:17.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go away, cheesehead
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.35,0:08:19.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没看到我要等车碾过来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:19.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm trying to get run over?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.02,0:08:20.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有更好的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:20.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, better yet
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.99,0:08:22.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你直接使劲踩死我得了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:22.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just step on me as hard as you can
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.86,0:08:23.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:23.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you do that for me?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.80,0:08:24.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:24.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.79,0:08:26.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样跟我的善良本性背道而驰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:26.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but that flies in the face of my good nature
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.48,0:08:27.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:27.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forget it, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.87,0:08:30.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下一班车好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:30.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just wait for the next bus
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.50,0:08:34.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回蟹堡王开开心心做蟹黄堡去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:34.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go on back to the krusty krab and enjoy yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.01,0:08:35.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:35.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  小不点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good-bye, pip-squeak
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.97,0:08:42.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你幸灾乐祸  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.97,0:08:42.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt your gloating, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.55,0:08:44.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得应该要提醒你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:44.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just thought it would be pertinent for you to know
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.29,0:08:46.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板现在绝望地躺在大街上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:46.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that Plankton's laying in the street, forlorn
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.80,0:08:48.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:48.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下他完了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a mess
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.77,0:08:54.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  虽然你跟痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.77,0:08:54.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, I know you and Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实是死对头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are sworn enemies and all
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.18,0:08:58.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可你穿裙子吓唬他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:58.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but putting on a dress to frighten him?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.35,0:09:00.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是有点太过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:00.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't that taking it a little too far?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不要我再提醒你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Need I remind you of the fact
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.46,0:09:05.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你泄露了我保险箱的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:05.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that you disclosed the location of me safe
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而保险箱里面放的正是秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where I keep the secret formula?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.67,0:09:08.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用了  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:08.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to remind me, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.10,0:09:11.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我违反了蟹堡王规定手册的第二条
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:11.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I broke rule number two of the krusty krab rule book
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(982,672)}蟹堡王规定手册
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.70,0:09:13.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不得泄露秘密配方的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:13.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never disclose the location of the secret formula
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.20,0:09:14.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:14.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.99,0:09:16.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以补救
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:16.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can fix this
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.00,0:09:21.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想在这被车碾怎么就这么难
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:21.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Man, what does it take to get run over around here?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.27,0:09:22.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:22.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.45,0:09:24.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了  耳朵进泥巴了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.45,0:09:24.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What, do you got mud in your ears?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.15,0:09:25.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:25.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take a hike
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.21,0:09:27.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了  想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:27.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, I remember
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.17,0:09:29.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过长话短说  我想提醒一下你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:29.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But very quickly, I just wanted to let you know
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王秘方不在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that the Krabby Patty secret formula is not
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.28,0:09:31.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,重复
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:31.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I repeat
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.73,0:09:34.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不在蟹堡王画后边的保险箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:34.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not in the safe behind the painting at the krusty krab
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.52,0:09:36.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,关我什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:36.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why should I care?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的一生不再有意义了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All meaning has left my life
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.92,0:09:40.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自从那头鲸鱼一直在困扰我就这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:40.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,ever since I've been plagued by that blasted whale
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.75,0:09:41.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:41.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.80,0:09:43.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家心底都有恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:43.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody has a secret fear
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.89,0:09:46.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比如蟹老板心底的恐惧就是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:46.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For instance, Mr. Krabs' secret fear is
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.65,0:09:48.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:48.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.63,0:09:50.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.63,0:09:50.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And guess what else
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.62,0:09:53.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,之前那个其实是穿鲸鱼皮套的蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:53.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was Mr. Krabs in a whale suit
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一直都是他在吓你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that you've been scared of
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.45,0:09:57.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说  从头到尾都是蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:09:57.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean, this entire time it's been Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.76,0:09:59.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,伪装成了鲸鱼的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:59.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,masquerading as a whale?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.04,0:10:03.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一个狡猾的老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:03.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, that conniving bottom feeder
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好你也用不上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well luckily, you wouldn't have any use
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.91,0:10:07.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这种无关痛痒的消息  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:07.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for such innocuous information, would you?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.35,0:10:09.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:09.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course not
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.33,0:10:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All righty
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.30,0:10:12.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你继续自残吧  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:12.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Back to your self-destructive behavior, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.35,0:10:13.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你来谈心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.35,0:10:13.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the talk
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.47,0:10:15.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  谢谢你才对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:15.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太有意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is too much fun
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今后就这么一直玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I found me second calling
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板再也不成麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton ain't even a challenge no more
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.43,0:10:27.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:27.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that so
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.93,0:10:28.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:28.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.38,0:10:30.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又想找虐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:30.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Back for more, are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.07,0:10:32.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:32.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你吓不倒我  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.33,0:10:38.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不是老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:38.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I ain't Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.36,0:10:38.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:38.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.25,0:10:39.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.25,0:10:39.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.90,0:10:42.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是珍珍  才不是老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:42.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm Pearl, not Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.07,0:10:43.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早就穿帮了  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:43.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The jig is up, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.97,0:10:46.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道皮套的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:46.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know all about the suit
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.62,0:10:49.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还知道你心底的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:49.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and your secret fear
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,心底的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret fear?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.47,0:10:53.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:53.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.40,0:10:54.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自己看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:54.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See for yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尽情欣赏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the show
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.85,0:10:59.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:10:59.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.73,0:11:00.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.73,0:11:00.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.78,0:11:01.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:01.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.95,0:11:03.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快快  快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.95,0:11:03.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,M-M-Make it stop
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.87,0:11:04.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让他别演了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:04.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Make it stop
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.86,0:11:09.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,担惊受怕的滋味很不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.86,0:11:09.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doesn't feel so good on the other end of the stick
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不对啊  胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,does it, scaredy pants?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.62,0:11:14.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可太爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:14.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am loving this
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  我要是你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Plankton, if I were you
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.95,0:11:17.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就不会高兴得那么早
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:17.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so smug
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.65,0:11:18.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.65,0:11:18.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.67,0:11:20.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,外面出来了一大群饿肚子的鲸鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:20.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because a hungry pod of whales just showed up
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.55,0:11:21.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要来吃早点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.55,0:11:21.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for its early feeding
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.53,0:11:28.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别又来吃我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:28.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not another feeding
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快放我走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一个将功补过  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you redeemed yourself, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.71,0:11:45.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可真的吓到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.71,0:11:45.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, you really are creeping me out now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:50.23,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,小蜗恋爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:52.73,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:52.73,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:55.19,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:55.19,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(393.575,408)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:55.19,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(513.742,662)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:57.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:57.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.21,0:12:01.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:01.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.02,0:12:02.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:02.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.41,0:12:06.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正中瞭望台
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:06.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right in me crow's nest
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.32,0:12:10.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:10.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Monica
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.29,0:12:11.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,布拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:11.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brad
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.12,0:12:13.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:13.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Monica
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.17,0:12:15.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为再也找不到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:15.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought I might never find you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我发誓绝不与你分开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I promise never to leave your side
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.95,0:12:18.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,布拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:18.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brad
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.72,0:12:19.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:19.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Monica
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道今天什么日子吗  小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you know what today is, little guy?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.25,0:12:27.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天是去公园遛小蜗日
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:27.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's "take Gary for a walk in the park" day
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.85,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(474,740)}蜗牛公园
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.77,0:12:39.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是很棒啊  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:39.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't this great, Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.20,0:12:41.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,整座公园都是你的同类
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:41.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A whole park full of your own species
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.97,0:12:42.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:42.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开心玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a good time
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.79,0:12:48.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就坐一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:48.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just sit down for a second
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这位小弱鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, lightweight
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.32,0:13:27.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想对我女朋友做什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:27.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what do you think you're doing with my goil?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.42,0:13:30.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小玛  我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:30.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mary, let's go
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.21,0:13:38.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下你可错大发了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:38.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You just made a big mistake, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你的朋友说再见吧  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say good-bye to your friends, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.42,0:13:43.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游戏时间结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:43.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Play time's over
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做晚餐给咱吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got to fix us some dinner
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.00,0:13:48.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走了  小玛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:48.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mary
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.43,0:13:52.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还没玩完呢  小矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:52.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This ain't over, runt
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.87,0:13:54.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我把你打残
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:54.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When I get through with yous
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.47,0:13:58.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就连医生都不知道要把你嘴巴缝到哪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:58.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the doctor won't know which side to sew your lips back on
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.70,0:13:59.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,里去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:13:59.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.24,0:14:03.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个小矮子迟早会遭报应
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:03.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That little runt is gonna get what's comin' to him
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.45,0:14:09.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海草炖面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:09.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Seaweed noodle stew
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.87,0:14:16.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用餐愉快  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.87,0:14:16.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bon appetit, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.30,0:14:19.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在里面多加了爱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:19.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I made it with extra love
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.68,0:14:27.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟我想的不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:27.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not exactly what I had in mind
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.22,0:14:28.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过尽情吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:28.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but knock yourself out
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一二一二
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One, two, one, two
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.77,0:14:42.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一二一二
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:42.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One, two, one, two
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.12,0:14:43.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一二一
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:43.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One, two, one--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.50,0:14:45.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:45.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.53,0:14:47.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚餐吃得很爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:47.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That sure was a knock-out dinner, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.86,0:14:49.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吧  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:49.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.69,0:14:50.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要来睡觉觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:50.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's time for beddie-bye
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.49,0:14:53.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:53.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Night-night, gare-bear
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.25,0:15:33.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:33.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Gary
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:33.49,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(246,904)}小蜗
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.16,0:15:34.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:34.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.97,0:15:38.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可能是在蜗砂盆如厕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:38.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's probably using his snail box
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.25,0:15:40.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他昨晚吃的炖面里面还挺多面条的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:40.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was a pretty noodly stew he ate last night
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,躲猫猫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Peek-a-boo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:45.71,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1112,896)}小蜗
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也不在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not in here either
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.47,0:15:48.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:48.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.10,0:15:52.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得好好教小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:52.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to teach that snail
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃完自己收拾干净
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how to clean up after himself
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.75,0:15:57.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:57.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.83,0:15:59.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,难道是勒索信
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:15:59.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some sort of ransom note?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.59,0:16:02.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的海神王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:02.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Holy Neptune
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.77,0:16:06.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗被丧心病狂的爱蜗犯绑架了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:06.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My Gary has been pet-napped by a deranged snail lover
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.37,0:16:09.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你放心  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:09.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, gare-bear
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.02,0:16:11.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会救你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:11.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll save you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.61,0:16:15.78,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(372,356)}蜗牛公园
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.32,0:16:37.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟紧了  兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:37.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After me, fellas
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.44,0:16:43.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咱干嘛从来不走大门
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:43.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How come we don't never come through the front, guys?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.25,0:16:47.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏蛋不走大门
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:47.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause bad guys don't never use the front door
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.10,0:16:49.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本是胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:49.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I think that that's pretty ridiculous
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.24,0:16:51.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:51.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, listen up
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.78,0:16:54.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有谁看到某只蜗牛经过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:54.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Any of yous seen a snail come through here?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.90,0:16:55.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:55.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,About, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.77,0:16:56.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么高
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:16:56.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,yea tall
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.52,0:16:58.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个壳  两只眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:58.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a shell, couple of eyes?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.93,0:17:02.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得描述得再具体点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:02.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think yous need to be more descriptive
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.00,0:17:03.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:03.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.05,0:17:04.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.05,0:17:04.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see here
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.30,0:17:07.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那只蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:07.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This particular snail
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.00,0:17:11.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,觉得对我女朋友抛媚眼很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:11.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,thinks it's real funny to make goo-goo eyes at my girl
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.05,0:17:16.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们笑什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:16.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What you's gigglin' at?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.37,0:17:17.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都在笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.37,0:17:17.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They's gigglin' at me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.02,0:17:19.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都够了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:19.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, that's it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.55,0:17:21.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要把你们都记进黑名单
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:21.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You's all goin' on my list
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.75,0:17:22.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听到没
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:22.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yous got that?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.95,0:17:25.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全记下来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:25.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're on the list
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.00,0:17:36.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:36.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.65,0:17:39.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.65,0:17:39.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, where are you, buddy?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蜗牛黏液
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Snail slime
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.52,0:17:46.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看着可能是小蜗的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:46.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It looks like it could be Gary's
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.00,0:17:47.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,颜色对得上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:47.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The color is right
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.16,0:17:48.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黏稠度一致
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:48.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Consistency matches
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.55,0:17:50.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来验证一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:50.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now for the true test
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.21,0:18:00.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是小蜗的黏液
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.21,0:18:00.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is Gary's slime
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.65,0:18:02.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟上你了  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.65,0:18:02.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm on the twail, gehwee
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:36.05,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(634,336)}宠物店
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好啊  小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, hello there, little fellow
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.37,0:18:49.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是在流浪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:49.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you a stray?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.60,0:18:51.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以了  是不是舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:51.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There, now, isn't that better?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.50,0:19:07.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有  没看到有流浪蜗牛进来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:07.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, I haven't seen any stray snails come in here
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.56,0:19:10.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他那是想蒙混过关
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:10.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's trying to pull a fast one, fellas
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.55,0:19:12.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不如来给他尝尝看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:12.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't we give him a taste
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.06,0:19:15.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们伸张正义的独门绝技吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:15.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of our special brand of swift justice
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:17.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,两小时后
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.60,0:19:20.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:20.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's enough, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.00,0:19:22.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,事情办得很彻底
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:22.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think we've done a thorough job
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.84,0:19:25.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续去找蜗牛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:25.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's get back to finding that snail
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.85,0:19:28.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:28.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.00,0:19:29.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漏了一只
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:29.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's one left
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.39,0:19:30.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:30.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.12,0:19:33.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道你在里面  小矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:33.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know you're in theres, you little runt
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.60,0:19:51.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:51.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.75,0:19:53.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我回来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:53.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come back here
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.07,0:19:55.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帮我把店里清理干净
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:55.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got to help me clean this place up
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是你自找的  哈罗德
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You brought this on yourself, Harold
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.74,0:19:59.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才没有  哈罗德
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.74,0:19:59.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I did not, Harold
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.02,0:20:00.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是你害的  哈罗德
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:00.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did, Harold
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.12,0:20:01.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哈罗德  我才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:01.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Harold, I did not
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.67,0:20:08.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.67,0:20:08.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.70,0:20:09.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:09.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Move it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.70,0:20:16.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别挡路
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:16.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get out of the road
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.25,0:20:18.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这是想去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:18.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.90,0:20:24.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:24.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get him
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.79,0:21:08.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:08.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gehwee?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.86,0:21:09.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.86,0:21:09.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gehwee
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.82,0:21:12.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:12.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你上我车干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing in my car?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.82,0:21:18.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,二流子别坐霸王车
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.82,0:21:18.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No free rides, loafer
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.74,0:21:20.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.74,0:21:20.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.30,0:21:24.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放下我家小蜗  蜗牛绑匪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:24.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hands off my Gary, you snail napper
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.09,0:21:25.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蜗牛绑匪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:25.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Snail napper?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.00,0:21:29.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不稀罕你家的臭蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:29.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't want your dumb old snail
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.07,0:21:29.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.07,0:21:29.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.72,0:21:31.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那想必是小蜗大半夜溜出家门
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:31.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I suppose he wandered out of the house
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:31.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in the middle of the night
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.83,0:21:33.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,特地来跳进你家的车了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:33.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just so he could jump into your car
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.32,0:21:34.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别吵  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:34.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not now, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.96,0:21:35.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在骂她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:35.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm scolding
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.69,0:21:36.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想必
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:36.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I suppose--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.36,0:21:36.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:36.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.88,0:21:42.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你真的自己溜出家门了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:42.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You did wander out of the house on your own?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.45,0:21:43.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.45,0:21:43.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.24,0:21:48.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:48.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see why
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.90,0:21:51.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一个老掉牙的爱情故事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:51.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good old fashioned amore
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.97,0:21:56.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还没玩完呢  小矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.97,0:21:56.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This ain't over yet, runt
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.10,0:21:58.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.10,0:21:58.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Monica
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.96,0:22:00.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:00.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Monica
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.95,0:22:01.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,布拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.95,0:22:01.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brad
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.95,0:22:04.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.95,0:22:04.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Monica
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.22,0:22:05.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为再也找不到你了  莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.22,0:22:05.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought I might never find you, Monica
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.92,0:22:07.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来还在这里遛小比的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:07.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was just taking Billy here for a walk
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.42,0:22:19.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我发誓绝不再次与你分开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.42,0:22:19.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I promise to never again leave your side
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.98,0:22:21.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去买杯热咖啡喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:21.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go get a steaming hot cup of Joe
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.17,0:22:23.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,布拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.17,0:22:23.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brad
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.22,0:22:24.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.22,0:22:24.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Monica
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.98,0:22:26.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太伤心了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:26.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's got to hurt, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.56,0:22:30.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咱们走吧  小矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:30.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on, runt
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.47,0:22:32.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我带你去个超棒的垃圾箱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.47,0:22:32.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll show you this great dumpster
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.16,0:22:34.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到那吃点海草炖面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:34.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where we can get some seaweed noodle stew
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.72,0:22:40.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可别玩得太晚了  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:40.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't stay out too late, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.68,0:22:43.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小朋友长得真快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:43.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They grow up so fast
